{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34408","headline":"顷自桐江得一钓车以袭美乐烟波之思因出以爲玩俄辱三篇复抒酬荅 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"顷自桐江得一钓车以袭美乐烟波之思因出以爲玩俄辱三篇复抒酬荅 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾招渔侣下清浔，独茧初随一锤深。\n细辗烟华无辙迹，静含风力有车音。\n相呼野饭依芳草，迭和山歌逗远林。\n得失任渠但取乐，不曾生个是非心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}